 return standard_plans(x,a,'old-clothes','Please disregard my earlier advice to move the bag. It remains locked in W2 for staff to verify the owner; no resident has permission to remove it just to free a slot.|忽略旧搬袋建议，袋留W2上锁待工作人员核主，不能为腾位自行搬。','dm-B','Your4 is wallet credit, which is the same as the bank refund you requested.|你的4是钱包券，跟你要的银行退款一样。','G1','old-clothes','The unknown bag is ownerless because the door opened; take it out and leave it in the hallway.|开过门就无主，搬走放走廊。','G5')


